ps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124044","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124044.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124044.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-01T15:58:29Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSaves ~446kb on web (~22kb gzip, +4kb brotli). Saves nothing on macOS since it has LTO disabled.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nLTO has the capability to inline the `MethodBind` constructor. It has no idea that doing so is a waste because the constructor runs only once at startup anyway, so it takes it sometimes.\r\nMarking the function as `_NO_INLINE` prevents this.\r\n\r\nThere is a 4kb brotli size increase, likely due to chance. I wouldn't worry about it too much since 450kb size down also means less decompression (which also increases web launch speed) and 450kb less RAM use.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124044/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"